{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想清楚掌握每月開支流向，又不想把財務資料交給第三方？Money Expense Budget Bills Log 主打數秒完成記帳，並以圖表、日曆與預算功能整理收支，適合需要簡單個人理財工具的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>離線記錄收支與預算</h2>\n<p>Money Expense Budget Bills Log 讓你在數秒內記錄支出、收入與轉帳，並以清晰圖表呈現金錢流向。內置每月圖表與分類佔比、日曆檢視，方便回顧每日收支；亦可設定每月及各分類預算上限，管理多個帳戶與帳本。程式支援搜尋交易紀錄、匯入與匯出資料，完全離線運作，無需註冊。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-103-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-104-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-105-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-106-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-107-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Money Expense Budget Bills Log</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T21:58:28.249680+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":336,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}